      "seq": 0,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "那好，请坐。",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 960,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "这周过得怎么样啊？",
      "start_ms": 960,
      "end_ms": 2882,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "speaker": "1",
      "text": "嗯就是还是老样子，最近工作压力特别大，晚上经常睡不着。",
      "start_ms": 2882,
      "end_ms": 8646,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "睡不着的时候脑子里一般在想些什么呢？",
      "start_ms": 8646,
      "end_ms": 12729,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "speaker": "1",
      "text": "就是白天那些事嘛，然后会反复想领导说的那句话到底是什么意思，然后越想越清醒。",
      "start_ms": 12729,
      "end_ms": 21135,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "听起来到了晚上白天的那些事情会被反复的拿出来想。",
      "start_ms": 21135,
      "end_ms": 26660,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "speaker": "1",
      "text": "对，然后那个其实我也知道想这些没什么用，但是就是。",
      "start_ms": 26660,
      "end_ms": 32312,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "停不下来。",
      "start_ms": 32312,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "speaker": "0",
      "text": "嗯，停不下来本身可能比想的内。",
      "start_ms": 33340,
      "end_ms": 36680,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 9,
      "speaker": "1",
      "text": "容更让人累。",
      "start_ms": 36680,
      "end_ms": 37964,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 10,
      "speaker": "1",
      "text": "嗯，对，就是那种感觉，白天已经很累了，晚上还要继续。",
      "start_ms": 37964,
      "end_ms": 43360,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
